  "ruleText": "Ahp 101.01 Purpose. These rules implement the statutory responsibilities under RSA 328-F of the board of directors of the office of licensed allied health professionals.\n\nSource. #7401, eff 11-3-00; ss by #8077, eff 5-1-04; ss by #9517, eff 7-24-09; ss by #12724, eff 2-15-19",
